    "unknown_state_behavior": "Unknown target level deliberately selects the high-level Cleave55 and Whirlwind-first fallback. Unknown nearby-enemy or queue state never mutates the next-swing queue. Unknown cooldowns cannot satisfy cooldown comparisons; the high-level fallback queue does not require cooldown comparisons because its 55-rage base threshold dominates both reserve windows.",
    "known_behavior_gaps": [
      "The simulator adapter maintains Battle Shout, but the runtime exports neither the named aura nor its remaining duration.",
      "The simulator requires Berserker Stance before Whirlwind; runtime stance is not exported and the Cat2 Whirlwind card may request the stance itself.",
      "The simulator's explicit in-melee-range state is not exported; Cat2 action cards retain their own target and range checks.",
      "The simulator Execute phase begins below 20 percent while Cat2's Execute card uses below 19.9 percent.",
      "WAIT 100 ms has no direct game action because the macro-driven runtime advances only on the next invocation.",
      "The fixed thresholds encode the captured character's talents and Ravager rank; they must be regenerated after cost-changing talent or equipment changes."
    ]
